  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt naðor ne hy ne we ne underfon oðres wealh ne oðres ðeof ne oðres gefan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And neither of the two parties to the truce—neither they nor we—shall harbour a slave belonging to the other party, or a thief pursued by them, or anyone who is involved in vendetta with them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et ut nec ipse neque nos alterius seruum uel inimicum receptemus.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
